Metasploit, I worked very closely with the Metasploit team and every single time we released a Metasploit module,
there was controversy because we know the second that we published a Metasploit module,

22
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:32,510
Metasploit，我曾与 Metasploit 团队紧密合作，每当我们发布一个 Metasploit 模块时，
都会引起争议，因为我们知道只要一发布，脚本小子就会拿去攻击整个互联网。
the script kitties would pick it up and hit the entire internet with it.

