虽然所有这些工具在经验丰富的从业者手中效果更好，但它们确实提升了脚本小子，
甚至是那些对安全只有非常基础了解的人所能做到的事情。
While all of these tools work much better in the hands of practitioners that have deep experience, it really does elevate what,
you know, script kiddies can do or even folks that have even a very, very basic understanding of security.

