capable open weight models that are available.

36
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:36,036
所以开放权重模型与托管的前沿模型之间的区别在于，我们在每个请求之间设有分类器和政策。
So the difference between the open weight models and the frontier models that are hosted
is that we have things like classifiers and policy that can sit between every request.

37
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:40,590
我们可以看到谁有权访问这些模型。
We have some visibility into who has access into these.

38
00:04:40,974 --> 00:04:43,990
我们有能力在事后识别滥用行为。
We have the ability to identify misuse after the fact.

39
00:04:44,622 --> 00:04:49,890
而且在模型发布后，我们还可以调整边界、安全余量和分类器。
And we can also move the boundaries and the safety margin and the classifiers after the model is released.

40
00:04:50,050 --> 00:04:55,364
如果我们发现这些政策在某些地方失效了，我们有能力去更改和更新这些政策。
We have the ability to change and update these policies as we see that they, if we see that they have failed somewhere.

41
00:04:56,462 --> 00:05:07,990
说到开放权重模型，即使模型在发布时带有防止用户进行严重违规行为的防护措施，
这些措施也可能被微调掉或者被湮灭。
When it comes to the open weight models, even if a model is published with safeguards to not let you do particularly egregious things,
those can all be fine-tuned away or obliterated.

42
00:05:08,030 --> 00:05:13,450
如果有人听说过模型湮灭，那么你可以绕过开放权重模型中的任何护栏。
If any folks have heard about model obliteration, you can bypass any of those guardrails in an open weight model.

43
00:05:13,450 --> 00:05:16,550
所以，这些防护措施没有任何持久性。
So, none of those safeguards have any durability.

44
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:24,090
本地推理也意味着没有任何门槛来限制谁可能拥有这些高能力模型的访问权。
Local inference also means that there is no gate to who potentially has access to these highly capable models.

45
00:05:25,102 --> 00:05:26,190
没有使用信号。
There's no usage signal.

46
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,490
没有强制执行的能力。
There's no ability to enforce.

47
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:32,510
一旦开放权重模型发布，就就像神灯里的精灵被放出来了一样。
And once an open weight model is released, it is like the genie is out of the bottle.

48
00:05:32,650 --> 00:05:33,870
