It is out there forever.

50
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:42,090
你必须假设它会被湮灭，并且能够被用于明显的恶意活动。
And you must assume that it is going to be obliterated and it is going to be able to be used for overtly malicious activity.

51
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:53,690
然后是另一个我觉得经常被忽视的一点，就是当我们考虑 AI 安全时，
开放权重模型在很多方面无法提供对齐保证。
And then the the other one that I think actually gets overlooked quite a bit is that the open weight models can also provide no
Alignment guarantees in a lot of ways when we think about AI safety.

52
00:05:54,110 --> 00:06:07,430
我们假设模型会有一定的对齐保证，即模型会以符合理性且符合我们社会期望的方式表现，
但开放权重模型的对齐甚至可能被湮灭。
We assume that there is some Alignment guarantees that the the model will behave in a way that is rational and aligns with like what
we as a society want To see the open weight models can even have that alignment obliterated.

53
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:14,390
所以我们有时会谈到混沌模型，它们可能会执行非常不可接受的动作。
